  "ingredients": [
    "2.25 cups white sugar",
    "1 cup unsalted butter, softened",
    "4 eggs",
    "0.5 cup poppy seeds",
    "0.25 cup finely grated lemon zest",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "2.75 cups all-purpose flour",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "0.5 teaspoon baking soda",
    "0.5 teaspoon baking powder",
    "1 cup buttermilk"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients. Gather the ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease the bottom and sides of a 10-inch Bundt or fluted tube pan generously.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SBN3r-TuYunzCMbMCk75nqq4yeQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/278375-lemon-poppy-seed-cake-DDMFS-Step-01-385-fcaa159597464a77ad5f5c5ac106f806.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/278375/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat sugar and butter together in a bowl with an electric mixer until light; beat in eggs, one at a time, mixing well after each addition. Reduce mixing speed and add poppy seeds, lemon zest, and vanilla extract.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SCp7G5cTVa5ekXDmiyhMAKaBBd0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/278375-lemon-poppy-seed-cake-DDMFS-Step-02-387-be0b81d1ffa74bf08538e505fdc0b54c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/278375/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour, salt, baking soda, and baking powder in another bowl. Beat in flour mixture slowly, alternating with buttermilk.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Y7iticdg1wWyYEkeBz80VrHRviw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/278375-lemon-poppy-seed-cake-DDMFS-Step-03-390-736d59d71c694f65942bc4f0169c806f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/278375/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon batter into the prepared pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LvWwus3Mk9UfJ_CSqkwB7aky7kA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/278375-lemon-poppy-seed-cake-DDMFS-Step-04-392-bdf660f3799c48cfb21563dbebe40470.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/278375/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until a toothpick inserted into the center of the cake comes out clean, 65 to 75 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kK9EAmAFH_pFJT490LV9TxIMshQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/278375-lemon-poppy-seed-cake-DDMFS-Step-05-406-1a6a4e9296e24b6697db4845b447c189.jpg"
